      "writtenOn": "2021-07-17T00:13:16Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Hook function is still return 1, \nv4l2subdev_bypass_code_hook(void *data, int *ret) {\n\n\t*ret \u003d 1;  /* just provide a flag */\n}\nMy question is if I can\u0027t change any original code even just a shift\nif (!ret)  //if hook exist, then ret is 1 and skip memset\n   memset(format-\u003ereserved, 0, sizeof(format-\u003ereserved));  //just shift code here",
      "parentUuid": "222c25f8_7ad44fa0",
